OL,3,AAustralia 'outraged' after Israel
OL,4,Adecides not to open criminal
OL,5,Ainvestigation into killing of aid
OL,6,Aworker in Gaza
OL,7,
OL,8,FAustralia's foreign minister has said
OL,9,Fshe is "outraged" over an Israeli
OL,10,Fmilitary decision not to launch a
OL,11,Fcriminal investigation into the death
OL,12,Fof aid worker Zomi Frankcom, who was
OL,13,Fkilled in an IDF strike.
OL,15,FFrankcom was an Australian aid worker
OL,16,Fwith World Central Kitchen (WCK) who
OL,17,Fwas killed in Gaza with six other
OL,18,Fcolleagues by an Israeli airstrike in
OL,19,FApril 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
